5.1 Harness Licensing Costs
Harness pricing is based on the number of developers and services. While Harness does not publish detailed pricing publicly, industry reports indicate enterprise pricing of approximately $10,000–$30,000 per month depending on scale and features. The Harness subscription model is documented at https://developer.harness.io/docs/platform/subscriptions-licenses/subscriptions/ and licenses per module (CI per developer, IaCM per execution, CD per service).
